<title>HONG KONG: Boram Bank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Boram Bank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boram Bank has mandated Sanwa International Finance and Standard Chartered Investment Banking to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, Standard Chartered said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue will have a final maturity of three years but can be put annually. Pricing has not yet been set.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
